<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $1.25-$1.75 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $1.25-$1.75 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>$1.25-1.75 lower.  Trading slow. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    59.00-59.50, some 59.75-60.00</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    58.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    57.50-58.50</p>
<p>Sows steady to 1.00 lower. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    47.50-47.75</p>
<p>	    450-600 lbs    49.00</p>
</text>
